==English==
{{wp|Experience point}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|experience|points}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|p|sg=experience point}}

# {{lb|en|gaming|originally|RPG}} A system of points which, when a predetermined amount is accumulated by a [[player character]], causes them to [[level up]]. This is one of the core mechanics of many [[role-playing game]]s.
#: {{syn|en|EXP<q:abbreviation>|XP<q:abbreviation>|experience}}
#: {{ux|en| He got a few '''experience points''' by killing two zombies and two spiders.}}

